WEBVTT

00:00.067 --> 00:00.357
Alam mo ba

00:00.357 --> 00:00.808
na gusto ni

00:00.808 --> 00:01.468
José Rizal na

00:01.468 --> 00:02.139
maging probinsya

00:02.139 --> 00:02.892
ng Espanya ang

00:02.892 --> 00:03.713
Pilipinas?

00:03.912 --> 00:04.028
Oo,

00:04.028 --> 00:04.699
tama ang narinig

00:04.699 --> 00:05.057
mo!

00:05.257 --> 00:05.766
Pero bakit niya

00:05.766 --> 00:06.206
gugustuhing

00:06.206 --> 00:07.109
mapasailalim tayo

00:07.109 --> 00:07.860
sa Espanya?

00:08.060 --> 00:08.396
Hindi ba't

00:08.396 --> 00:09.090
ipinaglaban niya

00:09.090 --> 00:10.051
ang mga Pilipino?

00:10.252 --> 00:11.131
Noong ika-19 na

00:11.131 --> 00:11.675
siglo,

00:11.745 --> 00:12.497
nasa ilalim ng

00:12.497 --> 00:13.168
kapangyarihan ng

00:13.168 --> 00:13.840
Espanya ang

00:13.840 --> 00:14.684
Pilipinas.

00:14.884 --> 00:15.544
Pero hindi pantay

00:15.544 --> 00:16.111
ang trato sa

00:16.111 --> 00:17.025
mga Pilipino at

00:17.025 --> 00:18.066
sa mga Espanyol.

00:18.266 --> 00:19.065
Maraming Pilipino

00:19.065 --> 00:19.667
ang walang sapat

00:19.667 --> 00:20.407
na karapatan,

00:20.407 --> 00:21.148
at walang boses

00:21.148 --> 00:22.062
sa pamahalaan.

00:22.262 --> 00:22.586
At alam mo

00:22.586 --> 00:23.048
rin ba?

00:23.248 --> 00:23.502
Dati,

00:23.676 --> 00:24.498
may mga kinatawan

00:24.498 --> 00:25.204
ang Pilipinas sa

00:25.204 --> 00:25.875
Cortes,

00:25.875 --> 00:26.628
ang parlamento ng

00:26.628 --> 00:27.275
Espanya.

00:27.475 --> 00:28.911
Pero noong 1837,

00:28.911 --> 00:29.616
inalis sila.

00:29.816 --> 00:30.290
Kaya wala nang

00:30.290 --> 00:30.973
boses ang mga

00:30.973 --> 00:31.552
Pilipino sa

00:31.552 --> 00:32.107
Madrid.

00:32.306 --> 00:33.128
Kaya si Rizal,

00:33.128 --> 00:33.823
kasama ang iba

00:33.823 --> 00:34.552
pang repormistang

00:34.552 --> 00:35.107
Pilipino sa

00:35.107 --> 00:35.778
Espanya,

00:35.906 --> 00:36.924
tulad nina Marcelo

00:36.924 --> 00:37.075
H.

00:37.075 --> 00:37.816
del Pilar at

00:37.816 --> 00:38.857
Mariano Ponce,

00:38.904 --> 00:39.598
ay nanawagan ng

00:39.598 --> 00:40.188
reporma.

00:40.389 --> 00:40.783
Ang isa sa

00:40.783 --> 00:41.385
pinakamahalaga

00:41.385 --> 00:42.287
nilang panukala?

00:42.487 --> 00:43.124
Ang tinatawag na

00:43.124 --> 00:43.922
asimilasyon.

00:44.122 --> 00:44.701
Gawing ganap na

00:44.701 --> 00:45.222
probinsya ng

00:45.222 --> 00:45.859
Espanya ang

00:45.859 --> 00:46.657
Pilipinas,

00:46.657 --> 00:47.433
para magkaroon ang

00:47.433 --> 00:48.335
mga Pilipino ng

00:48.335 --> 00:49.331
parehong karapatan

00:49.331 --> 00:49.909
tulad ng mga

00:49.909 --> 00:50.638
Espanyol.

00:50.838 --> 00:51.440
Kasama rito ang

00:51.440 --> 00:52.308
muling pagkakaroon

00:52.308 --> 00:53.084
ng kinatawan sa

00:53.084 --> 00:53.766
Cortes,

00:53.778 --> 00:54.415
kalayaan sa

00:54.415 --> 00:55.167
pamamahayag,

00:55.202 --> 00:55.827
at pantay na

00:55.827 --> 00:56.753
pagtrato sa ilalim

00:56.753 --> 00:57.539
ng batas.

00:57.739 --> 00:58.398
Ipinaglaban nila

00:58.398 --> 00:59.081
ito sa sarili

00:59.081 --> 01:00.030
nilang pahayagan,

01:00.030 --> 01:00.262
ang La

01:00.262 --> 01:01.083
Solidaridad.

01:01.283 --> 01:01.699
Panulat ang

01:01.699 --> 01:02.359
sandata nila,

01:02.359 --> 01:03.296
hindi armas.

01:03.495 --> 01:04.154
Pero teka!

01:04.354 --> 01:05.199
Hindi ibig sabihin

01:05.199 --> 01:05.812
nito na gusto

01:05.812 --> 01:06.356
ni Rizal na

01:06.356 --> 01:06.889
mawala ang

01:06.889 --> 01:07.745
pagkakakilanlan ng

01:07.745 --> 01:08.659
mga Pilipino.

01:08.859 --> 01:09.611
Ang nais niya:

01:09.611 --> 01:10.005
pantay na

01:10.005 --> 01:10.618
karapatan,

01:10.618 --> 01:11.255
dignidad,

01:11.255 --> 01:11.972
at pagkilala sa

01:11.972 --> 01:12.794
mga Pilipino

01:12.794 --> 01:13.558
bilang mamamayang

01:13.558 --> 01:14.148
hindi dapat

01:14.148 --> 01:15.143
tratuhing mababa.

01:15.344 --> 01:15.749
Kaya sa mga

01:15.749 --> 01:16.502
nobela niyang Noli

01:16.502 --> 01:17.300
Me Tangere at

01:17.300 --> 01:18.457
El Filibusterismo,

01:18.539 --> 01:19.360
inilantad niya ang

01:19.360 --> 01:20.148
pang-aabuso sa

01:20.148 --> 01:20.714
kolonya.

01:20.913 --> 01:21.537
At heto pa!

01:21.737 --> 01:22.420
Sa sanaysay niyang

01:22.420 --> 01:23.312
Filipinas Dentro

01:23.312 --> 01:24.272
de Cien Años,

01:24.272 --> 01:24.839
nagbabala si

01:24.839 --> 01:25.418
Rizal:

01:25.499 --> 01:26.251
kapag patuloy na

01:26.251 --> 01:27.015
hindi pinakinggan

01:27.015 --> 01:27.733
ng Espanya ang

01:27.733 --> 01:28.647
mga Pilipino,

01:28.717 --> 01:29.527
maaaring dumating

01:29.527 --> 01:30.071
ang araw na

01:30.071 --> 01:30.823
hihiwalay ang

01:30.823 --> 01:31.679
Pilipinas.

01:31.880 --> 01:32.273
Kaya oo,

01:32.273 --> 01:33.130
bahagi ng naunang

01:33.130 --> 01:34.044
adhikain ni Rizal

01:34.044 --> 01:34.461
ang gawing

01:34.461 --> 01:35.005
probinsya ng

01:35.005 --> 01:35.641
Espanya ang

01:35.641 --> 01:36.486
Pilipinas.

01:36.686 --> 01:37.091
Pero ang mas

01:37.091 --> 01:38.040
mahalagang tanong:

01:38.040 --> 01:38.688
kung pinagbigyan

01:38.688 --> 01:39.452
ng Espanya ang

01:39.452 --> 01:39.950
kanilang mga

01:39.950 --> 01:40.563
reporma,

01:40.633 --> 01:41.489
magiging iba kaya

01:41.489 --> 01:42.299
ang kasaysayan ng

01:42.299 --> 01:43.109
ating bansa?

01:43.308 --> 01:43.829
I-comment mo ang

01:43.829 --> 01:44.454
sagot mo!

01:44.654 --> 01:45.094
At kung gusto

01:45.094 --> 01:45.406
mo pa ng

01:45.406 --> 01:45.950
mga ganitong

01:45.950 --> 01:46.459
kwento,

01:46.552 --> 01:47.443
i-follow mo ako,

01:47.490 --> 01:48.196
dito sa Juan

01:48.196 --> 01:48.971
Fact a Day!
